cmv2m5lm10250x2balhcfro4i	CMF Buds 2A	cmf-buds-2a	CMF-BUDS-2A	<p>The CMF Buds 2A provide a high-quality audio experience with enhanced features tailored for everyday use and immersive sound. These CMF By Nothing Buds 2A have a unique 12.4mm dynamic driver and a bio-fiber + custom TPU diaphragm, and they provide rich, balanced audio with Dirac tuning and Ultra Bass Technology for deep, accurate low frequencies. The CMF Buds 2A include six microphones in total, including four HD mics with Clear Voice Technology and an ambient noise-cancelling algorithm to ensure crisp call quality even in windy settings (thanks to Wind Noise Reduction 2.0). Bluetooth 5.4 provides seamless connectivity, dual device pairing, and compatibility with Android 6.0 and iOS 13 and above. CMF By Nothing Buds 2A also has Google Fast Pair, Microsoft Swift Pair, LED charging indications, and a low-lag Game Mode with less than 110 ms latency when used with a Nothing Phone. The controls are simple, with tap motions to adjust music, calls, and ANC modes. The CMF Buds 2A are designed for durability and simplicity in active lifestyles, with earphones rated IP54 for water and dust resistance and the case rated IPX2.</p><p>Block background noise with 42 dB Active Noise Cancellation and a wide-band frequency range of up to 2900 Hz, which filters everything from deep rumbles to common chatter. Transparency Mode allows you to hear external sounds without having to remove your buds. The CMF Buds 2A have four high-definition microphones with Clear speech Technology, which isolates your speech from surrounding noise. Wind Noise Reduction 2.0 reduces wind interference for clear calls anywhere.</p><p>The CMF By Nothing Buds 2A have an exclusive 12.4 mm Bio-fibre driver that works with Dirac-tuned audio and Ultra Bass Technology 2.0 to produce immersive bass, rich mids, and crystal-clear highs. With each listen, you will hear a broader and more balanced sound.</p><p>The CMF Buds 2A have IP54-rated for water and dust protection for the buds and IPX2 for the case. Built to withstand splashes, dust, and daily use, your sound will remain uninterrupted whether you are caught in the rain or pushing through a tough workout.</p><p>In Bangladesh, you can get original CMF Buds 2A From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest CMF Earbuds to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Star Tech Shop to get yours at lowest price.The CMF Buds 2A come with 6 months warranty (Please preserve box to claim warranty).</p>	MPN: B185\nModel: Buds 2A\n4mm Bio-fibre Driver tuned by Dirac\n42 dB Active Noise Cancellation with Transparency Mode\n4 HD Mics with Clear Voice Technology\nUp to 8 hours of playback, IP54 water and dust resistance	2899.00	3199.00	\N	IN_STOCK	0	5	cmv2m477g00i6x2ba4q28ppq5	cmv2m5lkg024xx2bab18kiewv	\N	\N	\N	f	t	2026-10-10 16:33:27.722	2026-10-10 16:33:27.722	2026-10-10 16:33:27.72	\N
