cmv2m6ngu032qx2bac8sdp7u9	TOZO Golden X1 Earbuds	tozo-golden-x1-earbuds	TOZO-GOLDEN-X1-EARBUDS	<p>The TOZO Golden X1 Earbuds , widely recognized as one of the most advanced models in the TOZO Golden X1 lineup, deliver an elite audio experience powered by a premium 12 mm dynamic driver that produces exceptional clarity, deep bass, and a fully expanded 12 Hz to 44.1 kHz frequency range. Engineered for audiophiles, the TOZO Golden X1 TWS supports Hi-Res Audio, LDAC, AAC, and SBC codecs while offering 16 preset EQ modes through the TOZO App for complete sound customization. These earbuds excel in noise control with 6 sophisticated Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) modes, including standard Noise Cancellation, Leisure Mode, Custom Pattern, Reduce Wind Noise, Transparency Mode, and ANC Off, complemented by triple-microphone ENC call noise reduction for ultra-clear calls. Featuring Bluetooth 5.3 and a reliable 10m wireless range, the TOZO Golden X1 ensures stable, low-latency connectivity for music, gaming, and calls. Each earbud carries a 55mAh battery, delivering 5 hours of playback with ANC on and 8 hours with ANC off, while the 500mAh charging case—equipped with an intuitive LED display—supports USB-C fast charging, 5V⎓500mA input, Qi wireless charging, and dual-earbud 5V⎓50mA output. Designed for durability and comfort, the earbuds come with IPX6 water resistance, smart touch controls, a lightweight 5.8g design per ear, and a compact charging case measuring 69.9 × 34.2 × 38.2 mm, weighing just 43g. Altogether, the TOZO Golden X1 Earbuds provide premium stereo sound quality, long-lasting battery life, advanced ANC performance, and seamless app support—making the TOZO Golden X1 TWS one of the best choices for users seeking top-tier wireless audio performance.</p><p>In Bangladesh, you can get the original TOZO Golden X1 Earbuds from Star Tech. We have a large collection of the latest TOZO Earbuds to purchase. Order online or visit your Nearest Star Tech Shop to get yours a