cmuznp5fx01nt55h5rmcd41jd	HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro	huawei-watch-fit-5-pro	HUAWEI-WATCH-FIT-5-PRO	<p>The HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro combines premium craftsmanship with advanced smart features for users who want style, durability, and dependable health tracking every day. This HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro Smart Watch features a lightweight 30.4g design with premium materials for long-lasting comfort. The Orange edition includes a sweat-resistant HUAWEI AirDry woven strap with a hollow-out gradient finish for a sporty appearance. The White and Black editions use skin-friendly fluoroelastomer straps that resist water and daily wear comfortably. A titanium alloy bezel and aluminum alloy mid-frame improve durability while maintaining a modern and elegant appearance. The White version adds aerospace-grade nanoceramic coating technology for improved resistance against splashes, dirt, and scratches during regular use.</p><p>The HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro AMOLED Smart Watch delivers vibrant visuals through a 1.92-inch flexible AMOLED display with 480 × 408 resolution and 328 PPI clarity. The adaptive LTPO refresh rate ranges from 1Hz to 60Hz for smoother animations and efficient power management. With 3000 nits peak brightness, the display remains visible even under direct sunlight during outdoor activities in Bangladesh. The 2.5D sapphire glass protects the screen against scratches and improves long-term durability for active lifestyles. Slim 1.8mm bezels and an 83% screen-to-body ratio create a more immersive viewing experience during workouts, notifications, and navigation. Users can personalize the interface using vibrant watch faces, stickers, widgets, and customizable themes for a unique smartwatch experience.</p><p>The HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro supports more than 100 workout modes, making it suitable for running, strength training, yoga, swimming, sailing, and professional fitness activities. The smartwatch introduces Mini-Workout mode with animated guidance for 30 movements targeting 10 body areas, including shoulders, neck, and back. Users can follow clear exercise instructions anytime without needing gym equipment or professional assistance. Real-time metrics track pace, heart rate, calories, workout intensity, and running power to improve training performance efficiently. HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro also supports third-party fitness apps like KeepStrong for more guided and interactive training sessions.</p><p>This HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro Smart Watch technology enhances outdoor activities with accurate dual-band and tri-band GNSS positioning support for GPS, GLONASS, BeiDou, GALILEO, QZSS, and NavIC systems. The smartwatch supports professional diving up to 40 meters with hover timer and water type identification features. IP6X dust resistance and 5ATM water resistance improve durability for outdoor adventures and water sports. Integrated sensors include accelerometer, gyroscope, ECG, depth, barometer, optical heart rate, temperature, ambient light, and magnetometer sensors for precise activity monitoring. Bluetooth 6.0, NFC support, microphone, and speaker functionality provide seamless connectivity for communication and smart daily convenience.</p><p>The HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro Smart Watch focuses heavily on advanced health monitoring through the upgraded HUAWEI TruSense system and TruSleep 5.0 technology. The smartwatch tracks heart rate, SpO2, emotions, stress, sleep stages, breathing quality, and menstrual cycle patterns accurately throughout the day. Emotional wellbeing monitoring displays twelve emotional states for better self-awareness and lifestyle balance. Sleep tracking analyzes deep, light, and REM cycles to provide detailed insights into recovery and sleep quality. The diabetes risk study feature uses continuous vital sign monitoring for healthier lifestyle management and better long-term wellness awareness. Personalized Health Insights convert collected data into practical recommendations that help users improve fitness, recovery, and daily habits efficiently.</p><p>The HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro offers reliable battery performance with up to 10 days of light usage and seven days of typical usage. The smartwatch supports wireless SuperCharge technology that fully charges the battery in approximately 60 minutes for greater convenience. Even with Always-On Display enabled, the device delivers up to four days of battery life. HUAWEI AMOLED Smart Watch compatibility supports Android 9.0 or later and iOS 13.0 or later devices without complicated setup processes. Wireless syncing, notifications, Bluetooth calling, and health data synchronization work smoothly across platforms. The smartwatch also supports wireless charging, operates between -20°C and 45°C, and uses a 5V-10V DC/2A charging system.</p><p>In Bangladesh, you can get original HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest Huawei Smartwatch to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Star Tech Shop to get yours at lowest price. The HUAWEI WATCH FIT 5 Pro Smartwatch comes with 6 months Official warranty.</p>	Model: WATCH FIT 5 Pro\nDisplay: 1.92" AMOLED (480 × 408 pixels), PPI 328\n3000-nit Peak Brightness, 2.5D Sapphire Glass, AOD\nConnectivity: 2.4 GHz, Bluetooth 6.0 and BR + BLE\nUp to 10 Days Battery Life, 5 ATM Water-Resistant	29999.00	30399.00	\N	IN_STOCK	0	5	cmuznnw8o000055h5y37yoebm	cmuznoxxn01d055h5e8mbhec9	\N	\N	\N	f	t	2026-10-08 14:53:20.973	2026-10-08 14:53:20.973	2026-10-08 14:53:20.971	\N
