cmuznp8um01rk55h5dmyb28po	Amazfit Bip 6	amazfit-bip-6-smart-watch	AMAZFIT-BIP-6-SMART-WATCH	<p>The Amazfit Bip 6 Smart Watch is a feature-packed wearable designed for fitness enthusiasts and everyday users who seek advanced health tracking, smart connectivity, and a stylish design. It boasts a 1.97-inch AMOLED display with a 380×450 resolution, ensuring crystal-clear visibility and vibrant colors, even under direct sunlight. The lightweight aluminum alloy frame enhances durability while maintaining a sleek and modern aesthetic, making it comfortable for all-day wear. Equipped with advanced biometric tracking, the Amazfit Bip 6 provides precise heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, blood-oxygen measurement, and stress analysis, empowering users with actionable health insights. With 140+ sports modes, including running, cycling, swimming, and race tracking, the Amazfit Smart Watch offers comprehensive fitness tracking, ensuring users can monitor their performance in various activities. The built-in GPS supports five satellite systems, including GPS, Beidou, GLONASS, Galileo, and QZSS, ensuring accurate location tracking for outdoor workouts. The AI-powered coaching assistant provides personalized workout plans that adapt to user performance and recovery, helping optimize fitness routines. Additionally, the voice assistant enables hands-free control, allowing users to adjust settings, check progress, and reply to messages using speech-to-text or a full QWERTY keyboard. The Amazfit Bip 6 Smart Watch also supports Bluetooth calling, enabling users to make and receive calls directly from their wrist, enhancing convenience for those on the go. The water-resistant design ensures durability, making it suitable for swimming and water-based activities without worry. With an ultra-long battery life, the Amazfit Bip 6 provides up to 14 days of usage, ensuring uninterrupted performance without frequent charging. The smartwatch also features smart notifications, music control, sedentary reminders, and free downloadable maps with turn-by-turn navigation, making it a versatile device for everyday use. Whether for fitness tracking, health monitoring, or smart connectivity, the Amazfit Bip 6 Bluetooth calling Smart Watch combines style, durability, and cutting-edge technology, making it an ideal choice for those who value performance and convenience in a wearable device.</p><p>One of the most noticeable features of the Amazfit Bip 6 is its incredible battery life. The Amazfit Bip 6 smartwatch can last up to 14 days on a single charge under normal conditions, and up to 26 days in energy saver mode, allowing you to focus on your activities without having to worry about recharging.</p><p>The Amazfit Bip 6 runs the improved Zepp OS 3.0, which provides access to a wide ecosystem of more than 70 downloadable micro apps and games. These may be easily handled via the Zepp App, which allows you to add and remove applications according to your needs and preferences.</p><p>For fitness enthusiasts, the Amazfit Bip 6 Smart Watch can track over 140 sports activities, like as walking and running, cycling, yoga, and strength training. It measures steps, distance, and calories burned, letting you stay on track with your fitness goals. Heart rate tracking, blood oxygen measurement, stress level evaluation, and sleep quality analysis are some of the reliable health monitoring tools accessible.</p><p>The sleep recovery tool of Amazfit Bip 6 is very valuable, since it provides specific information about your nightly sleep patterns, including deep sleep, REM, and light sleep stages, as well as monitoring daytime naps. This allows you to better understand and enhance your sleep quality over time.</p><p>The Amazfit Bip 6 allows for extensive customization, with over 400 watch faces available to suit your style and tastes. You may quickly alter the watch face or display information, as well as add your unique photo backdrop for a more personal touch.</p><p>In Bangladesh, you can get original Amazfit Bip Smart Watch from Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest Amazfit Smart Watch to purchase. Order Online or Visit your Nearest Star Tech Shop to get yours at lowest price. The Amazfit Bip 6 Smart Watch comes with 1 year warranty.</p>	Model: Bip 6\nDisplay: 1.97" AMOLED Touchscreen\nSupports Bluetooth Calling\n5ATM Water-resistance\nBattery Life: Up to 14 Days	10999.00	11299.00	\N	IN_STOCK	0	5	cmuznnw8o000055h5y37yoebm	cmuznp0f501gh55h5l8o3anwa	\N	\N	\N	f	t	2026-10-08 14:53:25.39	2026-10-08 14:53:25.39	2026-10-08 14:53:25.389	\N
