cmuzniiag09ehgeetoihsednv	Neumann TLM 102 Large-Diaphragm Cardioid Condenser Studio Microphone	neumann-tlm-102-condenser-studio-microphone	NEUMANN-TLM-102-CONDENSER-STUDIO-MICROPH	<p>The Neumann TLM 102 large-diaphragm condenser microphone, which comes with a space-saving stand mount, offers legendary Neumann sound quality at a price point accessible to independent singer-songwriters, working musicians, and home producers. The high SPL value of 144 dB of the capsule enables the clear and distortion-free recording of powerful sound sources like as percussion, drums, amplifiers, and other instruments. The TLM 102 offers a smooth vocal presence while avoiding overt sibilance thanks to its 8 to 12 kHz treble boost. As opposed to most other polar responses, the mic's cardioid polar pattern produces directed sound pickup in front of the capsule and strong rejection behavior behind it, producing less background noise. Although extra pop filters are available for even greater control, the inbuilt pop shield suppresses breath sounds and voice plosives. The transformerless output stage of the TLM 102 provides resistance to electromagnetic interference while assisting the mic in producing a clear character with lots of bass reach.</p><p>The TLM 102 was created by Neumann as a versatile tool for voice and instrumental recordings. The vital 8–12 kHz range, which is highlighted by its precisely tuned sound signature, is particularly important for human voices. The voice is given a regal presence in the overall mix, and the recordings acquire the smooth grace typical of large-diaphragm microphones. Despite this, the TLM 102 maintains its user-friendliness and handles difficult consonants or sibilants expertly because of the built-in pop shield.</p><p>The Neumann TLM 102 handles abrupt dynamics changes and high loudness changes without distortion. Because of this, it's a great option for drums and powerful amps. It reproduces sound pressure levels of up to 144 dB (such as a very loud trumpet at a distance of roughly 4") with excellent clarity: wide open, with strong bass and polished treble.</p><p>The Neumann TLM 102 represents world-class audio on a tight budget. Neumann reorganized the manufacturing process and eliminated non-essential features including pattern, pad, and low-cut switches. You'll notice what they didn't leave out the moment you hear the TLM 102: the Neumann sound, which stays true to its major inspirations.</p><p>The TLM series utilizes a transformerless output stage to provide a strong bass transmission all the way down to the lowest frequencies as well as a clear and direct sound that is extremely "close" to the acoustic source. The microphone is also robust to electromagnetic fields and lowers transmission losses thanks to its transformer-free output stage.</p><p>In Bangladesh, you can get the original&nbsp; Neumann TLM 102 Large-Diaphragm Cardioid Condenser Studio Microphone &nbsp;from Star Tech. We have a large collection of the latest&nbsp; Neumann&nbsp;Microphone &nbsp;for you to purchase. Order online or visit your nearest&nbsp; Star Tech shop &nbsp;to get yours at the lowest price. The Neumann TLM 102 Large-Diaphragm Cardioid Condenser Studio Microphone comes with 01-year warranty.</p>	Model: TLM 102\nLarge-Diaphragm Condenser Capsule\nHandles up to 144 dB SPL Distortion-Free\n48V Phantom Powered\nCardioid Pattern Lowers Background Noise	120000.00	120400.00	\N	IN_STOCK	0	5	cmuzlyoi300308ms0g704rz4a	cmuznii0n09eegeetbp3egpxq	\N	\N	\N	f	t	2026-10-08 14:48:11.032	2026-10-08 14:48:11.032	2026-10-08 14:48:11.03	\N
