ture is an advanced audio design that optimizes the alignment between dynamic and balanced armature drivers in hybrid driver systems. In traditional setups, magnetic interference between these drivers can reduce the armature’s high-frequency performance. To overcome this, NSAA employs an 11-degree angled alignment between the dynamic driver and the balanced armature, a configuration determined through extensive acoustic testing. This precise arrangement effectively minimizes high-frequency attenuation, resulting in clearer, more detailed, and accurate treble reproduction—enhancing the overall sound balance and fidelity for a more immersive listening experience.</p><p>The Enhanced Oval Acoustic Port on the EarFun Air Pro 4+ is designed for both superior sound and comfort. Its larger, shorter oval shape optimizes acoustic tuning, reducing sound dispersion for clearer audio with stronger sound pressure. Ergonomically contoured to fit the ear canal, it ensures a secure, comfortable fit, making long listening sessions more enjoyable without fatigue.</p><p>The EarFun Air Pro 4+ is equipped with 6 enhanced microphones, AI noise reduction, and cVc 8.0 technology to smartly isolate your voice and block out surrounding noise. This ensures clear, natural calls even in busy or noisy environments, making it perfect for work, travel, or on-the-go conversations.</p><p>In Bangladesh, you can get original EarFun Air Pro 4+ From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest EarFun Earbuds to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Star Tech Shop to get yours at lowest price. The EarFun Air Pro 4+ Earbuds comes with 18 Months warranty.</p>	Model: Air Pro 4+\n10mm Composite Dynamic Drivers\nAdvanced Qualcomm QCC3091 SoC with aptX Lossless Audio Tech\nQuietSmart 3.0 Hybrid Active Noise Cancellation up to 50dB\nIP55 Sweat & Water Resistant, 54 Hours Playtime, Google Fast Pair	10499.00	10899.00	\N	IN_STOCK	0	5	cmv2m477g00i6x2ba4q28ppq5	cmuzmu6yr05j03amv3gxsrqhm	\N	\N	\N	f	t	2026-10